//! Rust port of the C library `clibs/amp` (TJ Holowaychuk, MIT).
//!
//! Wire format:
//!
//! ```text
//! +------------+----------+------------+ ...
//! | <ver/argc> | <length> | <data>     | additional arguments
//! +------------+----------+------------+
